# The `!/automation/dinostack-worktree-reap/**` negation in the repo-root
# .gitignore overrides the repo-wide `.env`/`.DS_Store` rules by
# last-match-wins - without this file, a dropped telegram.env or a stray
# .DS_Store here would be stageable in a public repo. logs/ matches this
# package's own local log output convention (run.sh's LOG_DIR default is
# $SCRIPT_DIR/logs when run directly from this checkout).
*.env
.DS_Store
logs/
